    "limits": "The identity store signs a fixed domain-labelled message; the signature is verified locally and is not returned. Separate identity proofs contain signatures. The stack value is minimum free worker stack words since task creation; host time includes queueing, USB and polling. This is not a peer handshake, traffic key adoption, clock or contention qualification, or C9 lifecycle acceptance."
